Sokoban gives you much more rings and wands that don't start off in the 
hands of gnomes.

A wizard can do just about anything a wand can do better at high level, 
so it's best to burn off the wands early (whenever you run out of spell 
points) so you can get to those high levels.

Reflection plus magic resistance plus armor cancellation level 3 will 
see you to the bottom of the mines and then with the luckstone you can 
quickly get Magicbane.

